{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetro Battle is a competitive game of adventure and logic in 3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will be able to lift tetrominos that will appear on his &quot;board&quot;, rotate them to the orientation he wants, and will be able to place them on the bottom of the same, thus being able to create lines that will be added to the board of the opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The function of these lines is to complicate the opposing player, although they can also be helpful, as each line added will have a random empty space that when filled will have the possibility to return the line to the other player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aim is to achieve dynamic, chaotic and very fun games, testing the ingenuity of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character from over 30 possible options and over 20 hat designs to stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the arena to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various scenarios with their own thematic settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various abilities at your disposal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze your enemy, use smoke bombs to cover their vision, super speed, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against another local player in split screen or online with Steam Remote Play Together.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599150?t=1761782299","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3599150?t=1761782299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item