Various abilities at your disposal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze your enemy, use smoke bombs to cover their vision, super speed, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against another local player in split screen or online with Steam Remote Play Together.</p>","developers":["Marcos Palavecino","Brian Paspatis"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599150/2cdefed11e66b38e8d0b733e14cf0ac62b3bbdfd/header.jpg?t=1761782299","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3599150/1517163725/d19ae4bbf99de92672d459694348589260439eb9/1759718551/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759719112","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3599150/1517163725/d19ae4bbf99de92672d459694348589260439eb9/1759718551/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759719112","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3599150/1517163725/d19ae4bbf99de92672d459694348589260439eb9/1759718551/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759719112","id":257212403,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212403/movie480.mp4?t=1759719112","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257212403/movie_max.mp4?t=1759719112"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212403/f365b0f8af06fa1cb1bf9bedb096c68df4ad56f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759719112","webm":{"480":"https://vi